# mdeai workflow — lean orchestrator

**Deep refs (load only when class or user requires):** [`03-lean.md`](../docs/03-lean.md) · [`mdeai-proof-driven-delivery.mdc`](./mdeai-proof-driven-delivery.mdc) (P0 audit) · [`mdeai-skills-best-practices.mdc`](./mdeai-skills-best-practices.mdc)

## Step 0 — Classify (state in first reply)

| Class | Examples | Min verify |
|-------|----------|------------|
| **D** Docs/plan/spec/diagram | `tasks/**`, `plan/**`, `mdeapp/docs/**` | Links + mermaid validate if diagrams |
| **C** Code, no persona UI | lib, API, migration, hooks | Targeted vitest + `npm run dev` + curl |
| **U** Persona UI/agent/maps | `mdeapp/src/**` chat, cards, host | **C** + Browser MCP or Playwright + localhost screenshot |
| **S** Ship / PR / P0 / prod claim | merge, `phase:launch`, "check prod" | **U** + prod smoke + PR bot pass |

**One SAN = one PR.** Full title: `SAN-### · SPEC-ID — <Linear title>` ([`mdeai-task-naming.mdc`](./mdeai-task-naming.mdc)).

## Step 1 — Skills (≤3, not 5)

Router: [`.cursor/docs/02-skills-plan.md`](../docs/02-skills-plan.md) §4. Read `SKILL.md` before coding external APIs.

| Work | Load |
|------|------|
| Any implement | domain skill + `karpathy-guidelines` |
| UI/agent | + `copilotkitV1` or `mde-events` · forms → `shadcn` ([`mdeai-shadcn-first.mdc`](./mdeai-shadcn-first.mdc)) |
| Done / P0 | + `task-verifier` (class S only) |

MCP when touching Gemini, CopilotKit, Mastra, Supabase, Maps — not for class D.

## Step 2 — Implement

Surgical diff only ([`karpathy-guidelines.mdc`](./karpathy-guidelines.mdc)). Pre-flight **required for class C/U/S** on new features; **skip for class D**.

Lite pre-flight (chat table OK for C/U):

```text
SAN-### · title · Class · Skills · Blockers · Verdict PROCEED|BLOCKED
```

Full PREFLIGHT.md + TASK-LEDGER + persona updates → **class S / P0 launch only**.

## Step 3 — Verify by class

```text
D → markdown links; mermaid MCP or mermaid.live if ```mermaid```
C → npm test -- --run <pattern>; /localhost-probe or npm run dev + curl
U → Browser matrix below (localhost default); screenshot → tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/
S → U localhost proof + /prod-quick or /prod-smoke; cubic OR CodeRabbit on PR (≤15 files)
```

Persona-visible **Done/ship** claims → [`mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc`](./mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc) Tier 1 minimum.

### Class **U** — Browser matrix (localhost default)

Use **Browser subagent** or `@browser`. Viewport **≥1360px**. Hide inspector: `#cpk-web-inspector { display: none !important; }`.

Base URL: `http://localhost:3001` (or `:3002` in `mdeapp/.worktrees/*` via `dev:ui:worktree`).

Send each prompt in the CopilotKit textarea (`input` event + Send):

| Vertical | Prompt | Pass |
|----------|--------|------|
| **Events** | `salsa events this weekend in Medellín` | `[data-testid="event-card"]` ≥1 |
| **Restaurants** | `quiet rooftop dinner in Provenza` | `[data-testid="restaurant-card"]` ≥1 |
| **Cafés** | `quiet specialty coffee in Laureles` | `[data-testid="grounded-card"][data-result-kind="cafe"]` ≥1 |
| **Rentals** | `1BR in Laureles under $80/night` | `[data-testid="rental-card"]` ≥1 |

Also: pins in `[data-testid="map-panel"]` after cards (not "No pins yet"). Screenshot → `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###-<vertical>.png`.

**Class S on prod:** same prompts at `https://www.mdeai.co/` — see [`mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc`](./mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc) Tier 2.

**Slash helpers:** `/verify-floor` · `/classify` · `/prod-quick` · subagents `/localhost-probe` · `/prod-smoke`

## Step 4 — Evidence (class U/S only)

Path: `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###-<slug>-RESULTS.md` — **rows for checks actually run**.

Events ship → append [`tasks/events/changelog.md`](../../../tasks/events/changelog.md).

## Step 5 — Commit / PR / Linear

- **Commit:** only when user asks ([`mdeai-commit-discipline.mdc`](./mdeai-commit-discipline.mdc)) — suggest `git add` + message at slice boundary.
- **PR:** `Closes SAN-###`; bot review per class S table in [`03-lean.md`](../docs/03-lean.md).
- **Linear:** In Review with evidence link; **Done** on user OK — never from memory alone.

## Pairing (default)

```text
classify → skills(≤3) → implement → verify(class) → evidence(if U/S) → PR(if S) → In Review
```

